<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    How a god of each domain looks and comes (docs/design/gods.md, "Presence"; Source/ColonyCouncil/Gods/Presence/): one
    look a domain for every age (Rimfolk_GodLook_<Domain>), and an age variant where the age changes it (the Machine
    before the machine age, the War and the Craft among spacers). Everything named is looked up by name and skipped when
    it isn't in the player's game; the robes and crowns are tried in order on a person, the first that fits its body worn
    and recoloured. Sounds are one-shots or sustainers, played as each is; the sting is the first two that exist, the
    game's start sting under them where none does. Tracks are SongDefs (Anomaly's, Odyssey's, Ideology's, the player's
    mods'), after any the player puts in Sounds/Rimfolk/Gods/<Domain>/. Motes, effecters and circles are A RimWorld of
    Magic's first (Rimfolk's own motes and the game's flash stand in without it). GodPresenceTests checks every name
    against the player's mods (docs/player-mods).
  -->

